OL,3,GNEWSANational Grid substation wins
OL,4,Aapproval by one vote
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for an electricity substation in
OL,7,FLincolnshire have been narrowly
OL,8,Fapproved by councillors despite
OL,9,Fconcerns about the impact on the local
OL,10,Farea.
OL,12,FSouth Holland District Council's
OL,13,Fplanning committee voted six to five in
OL,14,Ffavour of National Grid's application
OL,15,Ffor a 400kV substation at Weston Marsh,
OL,16,Fnear Spalding, with two abstentions.
OL,18,FThe substation is part of the Grimsby
OL,19,Fto Walpole power line project, which
OL,20,Fincludes 87 miles (140km) of pylons
OL,21,Facross Lincolnshire to strengthen the
OL,22,FUK's electricity network.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
