OL,3,GNEWSANational Grid substation wins
OL,4,Aapproval by one vote
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal residents and some councillors
OL,7,Fobjected to the plans, arguing they
OL,8,Fwould destroy high-quality farmland,
OL,9,Fharm the landscape and increase traffic
OL,10,Fon narrow rural roads.
